provider: gotify (Gotify)

## minimal config
{
  "app_token": "secret-app_token",
  "server": "https://gotify.example.com"
}

### down
POST https://gotify.example.com/message
X-Gotify-Key: secret-app_token
(json)
{
  "extras": {
    "client::display": {
      "contentType": "text/markdown"
    },
    "client::notification": {
